# No secrets are required: all models (attacker, judge, targets) run locally via Ollama.
# Model names and Ollama URLs are configured in config/models.yaml.
# The scope guard (redteam/scope_guard.py) only allows http://localhost:11434 / http://127.0.0.1:11434.
# The scripts call python-dotenv, so a local .env file is loaded if present. Never commit it.
